\date{2025-11-04T18:48:26Z}
\title{Robots}

\import{swarm-macros}

\p{Each robot has:

\ul{
  \li{an [inventory](0012), containing a number of [entities](000X), and}
  \li{a set of equipped [devices](000X).}
}

In order to confer capabilities, a device must be \em{equipped}, that is, moved from the robot's general inventory to the special set of equipped devices. Entities can be moved between the inventory and equipped set via the \tt{equip} and \tt{unequip} commands.
}